entries[283914] = { ["name"] = "Unstable Temporal Time Shifter", ["text"] = "2 sec cast\nReagents:\nMonelite Ore (12), Storm Silver Ore (8), Insulated Wiring (20)\nCraft an Unstable Temporal Time Shifter.\nProfession Trainer:\nBattle for Azeroth Engineering (85)\nCost:\n5\n25\n\nUse: Reverses the flow of time on a target that recently died, restoring them to life with 60% health and 20% mana. Castable in combat.\n\nChance to backfire, fast forwarding the flow of time on a target resulting in a loss of vitality.\n\nCannot be used by players higher than level 50. (10 Min Cooldown)\nRequires Kul Tiran Engineering\n(85)\n\"While this device can certainly bring the dead back to life, it may also bring the living to the brink of death.\"" }
entries[283915] = { ["name"] = "Unstable Temporal Time Shifter", ["text"] = "2 sec cast\nReagents:\nMonelite Ore (10), Storm Silver Ore (7), Insulated Wiring (18)\nReduce the materials required to craft an Unstable Temporal Time Shifter.\nVendor:\nNatal'hakata\nZone:\nZuldazar\nZandalari Empire - Exalted\nCost:\n1900\n\nUse: Reverses the flow of time on a target that recently died, restoring them to life with 60% health and 20% mana. Castable in combat.\n\nChance to backfire, fast forwarding the flow of time on a target resulting in a loss of vitality.\n\nCannot be used by players higher than level 50. (10 Min Cooldown)\nRequires Kul Tiran Engineering\n(85)\n\"While this device can certainly bring the dead back to life, it may also bring the living to the brink of death.\"" }
entries[283916] = { ["name"] = "Unstable Temporal Time Shifter", ["text"] = "2 sec cast\nReagents:\nMonelite Ore (8), Storm Silver Ore (6), Insulated Wiring (15)\nGreatly reduce the materials required to craft an Unstable Temporal Time Shifter.\nDrop:\nHigh Tinker Mekkatorque\nZone:\nBattle of Dazar'alor\n\nUse: Reverses the flow of time on a target that recently died, restoring them to life with 60% health and 20% mana. Castable in combat.\n\nChance to backfire, fast forwarding the flow of time on a target resulting in a loss of vitality.\n\nCannot be used by players higher than level 50. (10 Min Cooldown)\nRequires Kul Tiran Engineering\n(85)\n\"While this device can certainly bring the dead back to life, it may also bring the living to the brink of death.\"" }
